# Protected paths. The Gate (scripts/autopilot.ts) never auto-merges a PR touching these; it labels
# them needs-human. With GitHub Pro, also enable "Require review from Code Owners" on main.
# Supported shapes: /dir/ (prefix) and /file (exact). One `*` line exists for GitHub only (the share card, below).

# The loop's own guardrails: an agent must never be able to loosen the rules it is judged by
